=head2 SDL_ProcessIO

Description of where standard I/O should be directed when creating a process.

=over

=item SDL_PROCESS_STDIO_INHERITED = 0 - The I/O stream is inherited from the application.

=item SDL_PROCESS_STDIO_NULL = 1 - The I/O stream is ignored.

=item SDL_PROCESS_STDIO_APP = 2 - The I/O stream is connected to a new SDL_IOStream that the application can read or write

=item SDL_PROCESS_STDIO_REDIRECT = 3 - The I/O stream is redirected to an existing SDL_IOStream.

=back



